  "byline": null,
  "publishedAt": null,
  "contentHtml": "<figure><a href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/%24s_!w6Is!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5de5d442-0449-4f37-a82b-7e09457b3074_2756x748.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n<img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/%24s_!w6Is!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5de5d442-0449-4f37-a82b-7e09457b3074_2756x748.png\" width=\"1456\" height=\"395\" data-size=\"normal\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n\n\n</a></figure>\n<p>In this space on Saturdays, I <a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/t/roundup\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">do a weekly round-up</a> of sorts: Sifting through what I wrote that you might have missed during the week, what I’ve been reading and watching myself, and some other fun things that have been going on.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/subscribe?\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p>\n<hr>\n<h4>📝 What I did this week</h4>\n<p><em>Here are the things I wrote or podcasted about during the previous week, sorted in descending order by quality, popularity and/or current relevance.</em></p>\n<p><strong>📊 My <a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/t/updating-model\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Odds/Models</a>: <a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/2026-nfl-odds-tracker-and-elo-ratings\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">NFL </a></strong>| <strong><a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/2026-mlb-elo-power-ratings-playoff\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">MLB </a></strong>| <strong><a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/2026-wnba-elo-team-power-rankings\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">WNBA </a></strong>| <strong><a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/2026-27-nba-elo-forecast-and-player\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">NBA</a></strong> | <strong><a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/2026-27-nhl-team-elo-power-rankings\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">NHL </a></strong>| <strong><a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/2026-college-football-odds-tracker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">CFB</a></strong> | <strong><a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/2026-27-english-premier-league-tracker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">EPL</a> | <a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/2026-nascar-cup-series-driver-rankings\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">NASCAR</a></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><p>⚾ <strong><a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/the-yankees-and-padres-have-entered\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">The Yankees and Padres Have Entered the Chat </a></strong>- Ahead of MLB’s Division Series, I looked at how dominant Wild Card sweeps by the Yankees and Padres changed the state of the postseason, and whether we should change our priors that the Dodgers, Brewers and Rays are the teams to beat.</p></li>\n<li><p>🏈 <strong><a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/dennis-miller-on-monday-night-football\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Dennis Miller On Monday Night Football Was Weird. But the Games Were Great.</a></strong> - With a new HBO retrospective revisiting Dennis Miller’s strange stint in the booth, I looked back at the comedian’s widely-mocked run (perhaps unfairly so?) on Monday Night Football from 2000-2001 — and how it happened to coincide with some of the best on-field action in MNF history.</p></li>\n<li><p>🏒 <strong><a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/will-the-loser-point-wreck-the-nhl\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Will the Loser Point Wreck the NHL Standings Again?</a></strong> - Heading into the brand-new 2026-27 NHL season (<a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/2026-27-nhl-team-elo-power-rankings\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">check out the Elo forecast here</a>!), I examined how the league’s silly standings format generated a record number of 3-point games last year — and why giving extra points for OT/SO losers threatens to scramble another playoff race.</p></li>\n<li><p>🏈 <strong><a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/can-week-4-of-the-2026-nfl-season\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Can Week 4 of the 2026 NFL Season Just Be Normal Again?</a></strong> - After a chaotic Week 3 where half of the winning teams were outgained by their opponents — led by the Chargers’ classic case of “Chargering” in Buffalo — I broke down the statistical anomalies that defined a bizarre NFL week and what to expect looking ahead to Week 4.</p></li>\n<li><p>⚾ <strong><a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/who-can-win-the-2026-world-series\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Who Can Win the 2026 World Series? (And Other Burning Postseason Questions.)</a></strong> - Ahead of the 2026 MLB postseason, I <a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/2026-mlb-elo-power-ratings-playoff\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">crunched 50,000 Elo simulations</a> to project the playoffs — and looked at why the top-seeded Brewers and Rays face lingering skepticism despite dominant regular seasons.</p></li>\n<li>\n<p>🏁 <strong><a href=\"https://www.nascar.com/news-media/2026/10/01/analysis-can-anything-slow-down-the-kyle-larson-championship-train/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Can anything slow down the Kyle Larson championship train?</a></strong> - For  this week, I analyzed Kyle Larson’s sudden playoff momentum and, with him driving <em>this </em>well early on, whether anybody can derail his march toward yet another Cup Series title (including two in a row in two different formats).</p>\n<ul><li><p>🏁🎙️ <strong><a href=\"https://open.spotify.com/episode/6Jzh9tLojzD7Q4UTZ0Qyvt?si=WULo6ZesRUOxqHzrxlkC9A\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Podracing: Okay, NOW he’s back</a></strong> - In this week’s , <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/tyler-lauletta-b0399667/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> Lauletta</a> and I gabbed about Larson’s return to dominant form — and why he still needed to reclaim the lead from Chase Briscoe late — before we looked ahead to Las Vegas (a very similar track to Kansas) and asked why anything should be different this time around.</p></li></ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>📊 Charts of the week:</h4>\n<p>Here were some of my favorite viz items of the week from <em><strong><a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/scoreboard-newsletter-archives\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Scoreboard</a></strong></em>, my daily newsletter for <a href=\"https://sherwood.news/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Sherwood News</a>… </p>\n<p><strong>⚾</strong><em><strong> On MLB bye teams <a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/i/218513038/chart-of-the-day\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">no longer looking so rusty</a>…</strong></em></p>\n<div class=\"reader-datawrapper\"><a href=\"https://datawrapper.dwcdn.net/j9aLT/2/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/e80f536c-64df-4a80-a7f1-200f4a888c23_1220x686.png\" alt=\"Bye teams win as much as they should now\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><p>Bye teams win as much as they should now</p></div>\n<p>⚾<strong> </strong><em><strong>On <a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/i/217821218/chart-of-the-day\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">how the MLB playoff picture would change</a> with a different seeding system…</strong></em></p>\n<div class=\"reader-datawrapper\"><a href=\"https://datawrapper.dwcdn.net/0o6Gt/1/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/cf933527-3168-4cf6-a666-1b184ddbda80_1220x1094.png\" alt=\"Winners and losers if MLB changed playoff formats\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><p>Winners and losers if MLB changed playoff formats</p></div>\n<p>🏒<strong> </strong><em><strong>On the <a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/i/218350954/chart-of-the-day\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">NFL’s strangest weeks</a>…</strong></em></p>\n<div class=\"reader-datawrapper\"><a href=\"https://datawrapper.dwcdn.net/NGR3n/1/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/11b43ce4-ad8e-43e8-b31c-1c169c29f511_1220x1754.png\" alt=\"The most unhinged weeks\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><p>The most unhinged weeks</p></div>\n<p><strong>🏈</strong><em><strong> On the best <a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/i/218001637/chart-of-the-day\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">QB EPA performances after 1,000+ days of rest</a> (a la Case Keenum)…</strong></em></p>\n<div></div>\n<p><em>Subscribe to <strong>Scoreboard</strong> by <strong><a href=\"https://join.sherwood.news/scoreboard\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">clicking here</a></strong>!</em></p>\n<h4>👀 Some interesting things I read/watched this week</h4>\n<p><em>A collection of articles (with a heavy focus on my fellow Substackers), videos and other media that I enjoyed and/or found thought-provoking over the past week. I don’t always 100% agree with or endorse what’s linked here… but that’s also sort of the point.</em></p>\n<ul>\n<li><p><strong>⚾▶️ </strong><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=QrxpHoQYbtM\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">“</a><strong><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=QrxpHoQYbtM\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">You’re suddenly watching MLB’s craziest night ever (2011 Game 162 Time Machine)”</a></strong> by <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@mlbvault\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">MLB Vault</a></p></li>\n<li><p><strong>⚾▶️ </strong><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UXXHPkv7u8o\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">“</a><strong><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UXXHPkv7u8o\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">GUYS Episode 32: Potemkin Guys”</a></strong> by <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@gamewinningrbi\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Game Winning RBI</a></p></li>\n<li><p><strong>⚾ <a href=\"https://ritmica1.substack.com/p/the-2026-alternative-mlb-awards?utm_source=post-email-title&amp;publication_id=5688290&amp;post_id=217697316&amp;utm_campaign=email-post-title&amp;isFreemail=true&amp;r=gwh9&amp;triedRedirect=true&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">“The 2026 Alternative MLB Awards”</a> </strong>by  </p></li>\n<li><p>⚾ <strong><a href=\"https://www.mayday.show/p/all-of-the-things-no-one-tells-you?utm_source=post-email-title&amp;publication_id=1844059&amp;post_id=218451566&amp;utm_campaign=email-post-title&amp;isFreemail=true&amp;r=gwh9&amp;triedRedirect=true&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">“All of the things no one tells you about the MLB Postseason”</a></strong> by  </p></li>\n<li><p>⚾ <strong><a href=\"https://mlbdailydingers.substack.com/p/mlbs-40-hr-club-grew-in-2026-but?utm_source=post-email-title&amp;publication_id=2748109&amp;post_id=218357419&amp;utm_campaign=email-post-title&amp;isFreemail=true&amp;r=gwh9&amp;triedRedirect=true&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">“MLB’s 40-HR Club Grew in 2026, But Nobody Reached 50”</a></strong> by  </p></li>\n<li><p><strong>⚾ <a href=\"https://throwbacks.substack.com/p/the-greatest-postseason-in-history?utm_source=post-email-title&amp;publication_id=31587&amp;post_id=217858427&amp;utm_campaign=email-post-title&amp;isFreemail=false&amp;r=gwh9&amp;triedRedirect=true&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">“The Greatest Postseason in History Was Also the Beginning of the End of Baseball As We Know It”</a> </strong>by  </p></li>\n<li><p><strong>⚾<a href=\"https://almostcooperstown.substack.com/p/bryce-harper-vs-harmon-killebrew?utm_source=post-email-title&amp;publication_id=1216321&amp;post_id=218065246&amp;utm_campaign=email-post-title&amp;isFreemail=true&amp;r=gwh9&amp;triedRedirect=true&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> “Bryce Harper vs. Harmon Killebrew: What Hall of Famers look like”</a></strong> by  </p></li>\n<li><p>🏀 <strong><a href=\"https://knicksfilmschool.substack.com/p/ode-g?utm_source=post-email-title&amp;publication_id=7327&amp;post_id=217158133&amp;utm_campaign=email-post-title&amp;isFreemail=true&amp;r=gwh9&amp;triedRedirect=true&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">“Ode G”</a></strong> by  </p></li>\n<li><p><strong>🏀 <a href=\"https://hoopinformatics.substack.com/p/how-top-heavy-is-every-nba-payroll?utm_source=post-email-title&amp;publication_id=2045970&amp;post_id=218268215&amp;utm_campaign=email-post-title&amp;isFreemail=true&amp;r=gwh9&amp;triedRedirect=true&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">“How Top-Heavy Is Every NBA Payroll”</a> </strong>by  </p></li>\n<li><p><strong>🏀 <a href=\"https://www.petcashpost.com/p/inside-look-at-basketball-technology?utm_source=post-email-title&amp;publication_id=292272&amp;post_id=215543240&amp;utm_campaign=email-post-title&amp;isFreemail=true&amp;r=gwh9&amp;triedRedirect=true&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">“Inside Look at Basketball Technology (and the transformation of the game)”</a> </strong>by  </p></li>\n<li><p><strong>🏀 <a href=\"https://www.natesilver.net/p/nba-future-of-the-franchise-rankings-6cb?utm_source=post-email-title&amp;publication_id=1198116&amp;post_id=212179789&amp;utm_campaign=email-post-title&amp;isFreemail=true&amp;r=gwh9&amp;triedRedirect=true&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blan